**WebSocket message handling:**
- `'joined'`: Initializes statements, currentRoundCount, threshold, topic from server
- `'statements_updated'`: Updates statements array, currentRoundCount, threshold
- `'threshold_reached'`: Auto-switches view to 'statements', fires notification
- `'vote_updated'`: Updates single statement with new vote counts and myVote status

